{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/2026-07-05-tennis-rallies-court-surfaces-smart-choices/audio/main-3f122d5f07bf.mp3","durationSec":136.128,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":1.68,"text":"A tennis point starts with a serve."},{"start":2.38,"end":4.38,"text":"The other player tries to return the ball."},{"start":5.46,"end":10.16,"text":"If both players keep hitting the ball over the net and inside the court, they are in a rally."},{"start":11.1,"end":13.62,"text":"A rally is like a small conversation with the ball."},{"start":14.48,"end":17.02,"text":"One player hits deep to push the other player back."},{"start":17.6,"end":20.5,"text":"The next player may return safely to stay in the point."},{"start":21.22,"end":23.48,"text":"Then someone may see open space and attack."},{"start":24.64,"end":27.24,"text":"A safe shot gives the player more room for error."},{"start":27.96,"end":30.94,"text":"It often goes higher over the net or deeper into the court."},{"start":32.16,"end":33.38,"text":"Safe does not mean weak."},{"start":34.34,"end":37.3,"text":"A deep safe shot can make the opponent move back and wait."},{"start":38.18,"end":40.76,"text":"A risky shot tries to finish the point faster."},{"start":41.82,"end":46.66,"text":"It may go close to a line, close to the net, or into a small open space."},{"start":47.58,"end":49.72,"text":"If it works, the player may win the point."},{"start":50.14,"end":51.96,"text":"If it misses, the point is over."},{"start":53.08,"end":55.14,"text":"Good tennis players do not attack every ball."},{"start":55.14,"end":60.94,"text":"They ask a quick question: Is this a good moment to stay safe, or is this the moment to take a risk?"},{"start":60.94,"end":64.5,"text":"Tennis is played on different court surfaces."},{"start":65.1,"end":68,"text":"The main three are clay, grass, and hard court."},{"start":68.76,"end":72.36,"text":"The surface changes how the ball bounces and how fast a point can feel."},{"start":73.3,"end":76,"text":"Clay often makes the ball slower and higher after the bounce."},{"start":76.62,"end":79.56,"text":"This can make rallies longer, so patience matters."},{"start":80.86,"end":85.7,"text":"Grass often makes the ball stay lower and move faster, so quick reactions matter."},{"start":86.64,"end":89.68,"text":"Hard courts are often more balanced, so many styles can work."},{"start":90.56,"end":93.04,"text":"The same player may need a different plan on each surface."},{"start":93.84,"end":96.2,"text":"On clay, one more patient shot may be smart."},{"start":96.8,"end":99.24,"text":"On grass, a fast first move may be important."},{"start":99.96,"end":102.84,"text":"On a hard court, balance and timing can matter a lot."},{"start":104.32,"end":107.26,"text":"The four Grand Slam tournaments show different tennis tests."},{"start":107.68,"end":110.1,"text":"The Australian Open is on hard courts in Melbourne."},{"start":110.1,"end":114.72,"text":"Roland-Garros, also called the French Open, is on clay in Paris."},{"start":115.7,"end":117.36,"text":"Wimbledon is on grass in London."},{"start":118.16,"end":120.8,"text":"The US Open is on hard courts in New York."},{"start":121.8,"end":123.74,"text":"These names are not only sports trivia."},{"start":124.28,"end":126.94,"text":"They show why a player needs more than one plan."},{"start":127.82,"end":129.54,"text":"On clay, patience can help."},{"start":130.14,"end":132.32,"text":"On grass, quick reactions can help."},{"start":132.92,"end":135.66,"text":"On hard courts, timing and balance can help."}],"words":[{"text":"A","start":0,"end":0.18},{"text":"tennis","start":0.18,"end":0.42},{"text":"point","start":0.42,"end":0.72},{"text":"starts","start":0.72,"end":1.02},{"text":"with","start":1.02,"end":1.22},{"text":"a","start":1.22,"end":1.4},{"text":"serve","start":1.4,"end":1.68},{"text":"The","start":2.38,"end":2.44},{"text":"other","start":2.44,"end":2.68},{"text":"player","start":2.68,"end":3.02},{"text":"